510	Notes: type names are lowercased, spaces become underscores (`double_precision`,
511	`unsigned_big_int`); `CHAR(10)` loses its size and falls back to `type = sql("char")`;
512	a typeless column (`m`) becomes `blob`; generated columns get an `as { expr/type }` block
513	(`expr` includes original parentheses, `type = VIRTUAL|STORED` unquoted); `WITHOUT ROWID`
514	→ table-level `without_rowid = true` after the primary_key block.
515	
516	## `--format` templates
517	
518	### `{{ sql . }}`
519	
520	Command: `atlas schema inspect -u "sqlite://rich1.db" --format '{{ sql . }}'` — exit 0,
521	trailing newline present. Note: sqlite autoindex names are **regenerated** as
522	`<table>_<col>[_<col>...]` in this output (unlike HCL, which keeps `sqlite_autoindex_*`):
523	
524	```sql
525	-- Create "users" table
526	CREATE TABLE `users` (`id` integer NULL PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT, `name` text NOT NULL, `email` text NOT NULL, `age` integer NULL DEFAULT 18, `bio` text NULL DEFAULT 'hello ''world''', `created_at` text NULL DEFAULT (CURRENT_TIMESTAMP), `score` real NULL DEFAULT 1.5, `active` integer NULL DEFAULT 1, CONSTRAINT `age_check` CHECK (age >= 0));
527	-- Create index "users_email" to table: "users"
528	CREATE UNIQUE INDEX `users_email` ON `users` (`email`);
529	-- Create "posts" table
530	CREATE TABLE `posts` (`id` integer NULL, `user_id` integer NOT NULL, `title` text NOT NULL DEFAULT 'untitled', `body` text NULL, PRIMARY KEY (`id`));
531	-- Create index "posts_user_id_title" to table: "posts"
532	CREATE UNIQUE INDEX `posts_user_id_title` ON `posts` (`user_id`, `title`);
533	-- Create "composite" table
534	CREATE TABLE `composite` (`a` integer NOT NULL, `b` text NOT NULL, `c` blob NULL, PRIMARY KEY (`a`, `b`));
535	```
536	
537	For rich2 (FKs/indexes):
538	
539	```sql
540	-- Create "parent" table
541	CREATE TABLE `parent` (`id` integer NULL, `code` text NULL, PRIMARY KEY (`id`));
542	-- Create index "parent_code" to table: "parent"
543	CREATE UNIQUE INDEX `parent_code` ON `parent` (`code`);
544	-- Create "child" table
545	CREATE TABLE `child` (`id` integer NULL, `parent_id` integer NULL, `parent_code` text NULL, PRIMARY KEY (`id`), CONSTRAINT `0` FOREIGN KEY (`parent_code`) REFERENCES `parent` (`code`) ON UPDATE NO ACTION ON DELETE SET DEFAULT, CONSTRAINT `1` FOREIGN KEY (`parent_id`) REFERENCES `parent` (`id`) ON UPDATE SET NULL ON DELETE CASCADE);
546	-- Create index "idx_child_pid" to table: "child"
547	CREATE INDEX `idx_child_pid` ON `child` (`parent_id`);
548	-- Create index "idx_child_code" to table: "child"
549	CREATE UNIQUE INDEX `idx_child_code` ON `child` (`parent_code`);
550	-- Create index "idx_partial" to table: "child"
551	CREATE INDEX `idx_partial` ON `child` (`parent_id`) WHERE parent_id > 10;
552	-- Create index "idx_expr" to table: "child"
553	CREATE INDEX `idx_expr` ON `child` ((parent_id + 1));
554	-- Create index "idx_desc" to table: "child"
555	CREATE INDEX `idx_desc` ON `child` (`id` DESC);
556	```
557	
558	Formatting rules: backtick-quoted identifiers; each statement preceded by a `-- Create ...`
559	comment line; every column rendered with explicit `NULL`/`NOT NULL`; FK constraints inlined in
560	CREATE TABLE as `CONSTRAINT \`<n>\` FOREIGN KEY ... ON UPDATE <A> ON DELETE <A>`; expression
561	index wraps the expression in an extra pair of parens (`((parent_id + 1))`); empty database →
562	**empty stdout** (0 bytes), exit 0.
563	
564	### `{{ json . }}`
565	
566	Single-line JSON, **no trailing newline**. For rich1:
567	
568	```json
569	{"schemas":[{"name":"main","tables":[{"name":"users","columns":[{"name":"id","type":"INTEGER","null":true},{"name":"name","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"email","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"age","type":"INTEGER","null":true},{"name":"bio","type":"TEXT","null":true},{"name":"created_at","type":"TEXT","null":true},{"name":"score","type":"REAL","null":true},{"name":"active","type":"INTEGER","null":true}],"indexes":[{"name":"sqlite_autoindex_users_1","unique":true,"parts":[{"column":"email"}]}],"primary_key":{"parts":[{"column":"id"}]}},{"name":"posts","columns":[{"name":"id","type":"INTEGER","null":true},{"name":"user_id","type":"INTEGER"},{"name":"title","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"body","type":"TEXT","null":true}],"indexes":[{"name":"sqlite_autoindex_posts_1","unique":true,"parts":[{"column":"user_id"},{"column":"title"}]}],"primary_key":{"parts":[{"column":"id"}]}},{"name":"composite","columns":[{"name":"a","type":"INTEGER"},{"name":"b","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"c","type":"BLOB","null":true}],"primary_key":{"parts":[{"column":"a"},{"column":"b"}]}}]}]}
570	```
571	
572	For rich2 (shows FK/index-part encoding):
573	
574	```json
575	{"schemas":[{"name":"main","tables":[{"name":"parent","columns":[{"name":"id","type":"INTEGER","null":true},{"name":"code","type":"TEXT","null":true}],"indexes":[{"name":"sqlite_autoindex_parent_1","unique":true,"parts":[{"column":"code"}]}],"primary_key":{"parts":[{"column":"id"}]}},{"name":"child","columns":[{"name":"id","type":"INTEGER","null":true},{"name":"parent_id","type":"INTEGER","null":true},{"name":"parent_code","type":"TEXT","null":true}],"indexes":[{"name":"idx_child_pid","parts":[{"column":"parent_id"}]},{"name":"idx_child_code","unique":true,"parts":[{"column":"parent_code"}]},{"name":"idx_partial","parts":[{"column":"parent_id"}]},{"name":"idx_expr","parts":[{"expr":"parent_id + 1"}]},{"name":"idx_desc","parts":[{"desc":true,"column":"id"}]}],"primary_key":{"parts":[{"column":"id"}]},"foreign_keys":[{"name":"0","columns":["parent_code"],"references":{"table":"parent","columns":["code"]}},{"name":"1","columns":["parent_id"],"references":{"table":"parent","columns":["id"]}}]}]}]}
576	```
577	
578	JSON rules observed: types are UPPERCASE raw sqlite types; `"null":true` only present when
579	nullable; **no** defaults, **no** checks, **no** FK on_update/on_delete actions, **no** partial
580	`where`, no auto_increment flag; key order per table: `name`, `columns`, `indexes`,
581	`primary_key`, `foreign_keys` (absent keys omitted); index parts: `{"column":"x"}`,
582	`{"expr":"..."}`, or `{"desc":true,"column":"x"}`; empty database →
583	`{"schemas":[{"name":"main"}]}` (no trailing newline).
584	
585	### `{{ mermaid . }}`
586	
